patches/experiments/dwc2*               usb
patches/experiments/usb-*               usb
patches/experiments/termios-speed/*     usb
patches/experiments/rtl8152/*           network,usb
patches/experiments/lan78xx-*           network,usb
patches/experiments/ipv6/*              network
patches/experiments/mdns/*              network
patches/experiments/multicast/*         network
patches/experiments/netstack-*          network
patches/experiments/ns-list-snapshot/*  network
patches/experiments/sshd/*              network
patches/experiments/mqtt*               network
patches/experiments/ha-bridge/*         network
patches/experiments/late-dhcp/*         network,time
patches/experiments/timerd*             time
patches/experiments/timesync/*          time
patches/experiments/timezone/*          time
patches/experiments/sdhost-*            sdcard
patches/experiments/redoxfs-*           sdcard
patches/experiments/grow-root/*         sdcard,boot
patches/experiments/pi-clean-boot/*     boot
patches/experiments/boot-time/*         boot
patches/experiments/welcome/*           boot
patches/experiments/pkg-*               boot
